  integrated into Ukraine's soviet-era  tactical surface-to-air missile systems  and this provides the ukrainians with  additional capabilities to defend  against Russian aerial attacks we will  continue to support Ukraine's urgent  requirement for Air Defense capabilities  to defend against Russia's brutal  attacks which as you noticed continued  throughout the holiday season
 

